      "panel_id": "wormhole",
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 7.81,
      "text": "Through the swirling storm, Mika spotted a glowing tunnel. Unsure where it led, Mika steered toward the light."
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P02_L002",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "panel_id": "earth_view",
      "start_s": 7.81,
      "end_s": 12.16,
      "text": "Beyond the cockpit window, a little blue planet came into view."
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P02_L003",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "panel_id": "earth_view",
      "start_s": 12.16,
      "end_s": 13.53,
      "text": "A planet!"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P02_L004",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "panel_id": "simulator",
      "start_s": 13.53,
      "end_s": 20.97,
      "text": "Mika tuned the ship's simulator. Now it was gathering clues about the planet’s people, languages, and way of life."
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P02_L005",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "panel_id": "earth_approach",
      "start_s": 20.97,
      "end_s": 28.53,
      "text": "The simulator located the nearest spaceport. Mika set a course to land: maybe there, he’d find out where he was."
    },
    {
      "line_id": "CH01_P02_L006",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "panel_id": "earth_spaceport",
      "start_s": 28.53,
      "end_s": 31.512,
      "text": "Hmm… Where should I go now?"
    }
  ],
